# ==============================================================================
# NAME: Meta Complete Ecosystem Rule-Set (Meta.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Covers Meta AI / Llama, Facebook, Instagram, Threads, WhatsApp,
#              Messenger, Quest/VR (Oculus), Open Source Frameworks & ASN/IPs.
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,Meta.list,Meta,extended-matching
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
